      "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c2_icml_2023_measures_graph_network",
      "chunk_index": 2,
      "chunk_id": "s01_c02",
      "text": "This ICML 2023 paper measures a graph network instead by which equivariant polynomials it can compute.",
      "box": [
