      "anchor_id": "cue_s01_c3_authors_give_complete_basis_these",
      "chunk_index": 3,
      "chunk_id": "s01_c03",
      "text": "The authors give a complete basis for these polynomials, build tools to read off any model's exact power, and design a stronger network that reaches state of the art on molecular benchmarks.",
