      "anchor_id": "cue_s03_c2_equivariant_polynomials_polynomials",
      "chunk_index": 2,
      "chunk_id": "s03_c02",
      "text": "Equivariant polynomials, polynomials of the adjacency matrix that respect node relabeling, are natural candidates: subgraph counts and many structural features are exactly such polynomials.",
