      "anchor_id": "cue_s03_c3_knowing_their_full_space_which",
      "chunk_index": 3,
      "chunk_id": "s03_c03",
      "text": "Knowing their full space, and which a network can evaluate, gives both a fine-grained ruler and a to-do list of missing operations.",
      "box": [
        0.05,
        0.75,
        0.9,
        0.1562
