      "chunk_index": 4,
      "chunk_id": "s04_c04",
      "text": "Node-based banks equal one-WL, edge-based banks equal two-FWL, that is three-WL. Building on this, PPGN plus plus feeds in precomputed polynomial features, lifting it strictly above three-WL.",
